"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">14</div><h1>전치사 1 — 4격 지배와 3격 지배</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Präpositionen mit Akkusativ und Dativ</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 14의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">4격 전치사와 3격 전치사 뒤에서 관사와 대명사를 격에 맞게 바꿔요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">nach와 zu, zu Hause와 nach Hause를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">zum·zur·beim·vom 같은 축약형을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">사람은 전치사 + 대명사로, 사물은 da(r)-·wo(r)-로 말해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Die Kinder rennen <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Wald. (숲을 가로질러)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) durch den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) durch die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) durch der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) durch dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">durch는 늘 4격이에요.<br>der Wald(남성) → durch den Wald.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meine&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Blumen sind für <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mein- · Oma · 여성)</span> Oma.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 꽃은 우리 할머니 드릴 거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Blumen sind für <b>meine</b> Oma.</div>für는 늘 4격이에요.<br>여성 4격은 1격과 같아서 meine Oma예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;das&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Am Samstag spielt unsere Mannschaft gegen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Team · 중성 · 정관사)</span> Team aus Köln.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에 우리 팀은 쾰른 팀과 경기해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am Samstag spielt unsere Mannschaft gegen <b>das</b> Team aus Köln.</div>gegen은 늘 4격이에요.<br>중성 4격은 das예요. aus Köln의 aus는 3격 전치사지만 Köln은 관사 없는 도시 이름이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Mein Vater fährt nie <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Helm Fahrrad. (헬멧 없이는 절대 안 타요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) um</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) ohne</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) durch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) mit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'~ 없이'는 ohne예요.<br>ohne 뒤에 관사 없는 명사가 바로 올 때가 많아요 — ohne Helm.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Die Gäste stehen um <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Grill · 남성)</span> Grill.</div><div class=\"qko\">손님들이 그릴을 빙 둘러서 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Gäste stehen um <b>den</b> Grill.</div>um이 '~을 둘러'라는 뜻일 때도 늘 4격이에요.<br>der Grill → um den Grill.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;einer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Meine Schwester arbeitet seit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ein- · Woche · 여성)</span> Woche bei einer Zeitung.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 언니는 일주일 전부터 신문사에서 일해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Meine Schwester arbeitet seit <b>einer</b> Woche bei einer Zeitung.</div>seit는 늘 3격이에요.<br>여성 3격 부정관사는 einer예요 — seit einer Woche.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Nach dem Konzert gehen wir noch etwas essen&quot;,&quot;Wir gehen nach dem Konzert noch etwas essen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">콘서트가 끝나면 우리는 뭘 좀 먹으러 가요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Konzert</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">noch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">etwas</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">essen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">gehen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">wir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Nach dem Konzert gehen wir noch etwas essen.</b></div>nach dem Konzert(3격)가 맨 앞에 오면 동사 gehen이 두 번째, 주어 wir가 그 뒤에 와요.<br>essen은 gehen과 함께 끝에 놓아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;],[&quot;Schülern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Frau Weber macht mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(정관사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Schüler · 복수)</span> einen Ausflug.</div><div class=\"qko\">베버 선생님은 학생들과 소풍을 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Frau Weber macht mit <b>den</b> <b>Schülern</b> einen Ausflug.</div>mit는 늘 3격이에요.<br>3격 복수는 관사 den과 명사 끝 -n이 함께 가요 — mit den Schülern.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Morgen gehe ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Friseur. (미용실에)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zur</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) beim</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) zum</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nach dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람·가게로 가는 방향은 zu + 3격이에요.<br>der Friseur(남성) → zu dem → zum. nach는 도시·나라에 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Holst du mich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Bahnhof ab? (역으로 나를 데리러 와 줄래?)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) von der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) vom</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) von den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) vom dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">von은 늘 3격이고, der Bahnhof(남성) → von dem → vom이에요.<br>vom 안에 이미 dem이 들어 있어서 vom dem은 틀려요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zur&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Lena bringt jeden Morgen ihren Sohn <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(zu · Kita · 여성 · 축약형)</span> Kita.</div><div class=\"qko\">레나는 아침마다 아들을 어린이집에 데려다줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lena bringt jeden Morgen ihren Sohn <b>zur</b> Kita.</div>zu는 늘 3격이고, 여성 3격 der와 합치면 zu + der → zur예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;beim&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Ich war gestern <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bei · 진료받는 곳 · Zahnarzt · 남성 · 축약형)</span> Zahnarzt.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 어제 치과에 갔었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich war gestern <b>beim</b> Zahnarzt.</div>의사에게 가 있던 곳은 bei + 3격이에요.<br>bei + dem → beim Zahnarzt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Mein Opa hat Geburtstag. Ich backe einen Kuchen für <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">für 뒤의 대명사도 4격이에요.<br>er의 4격은 ihn이에요 — für ihn.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Ich habe lange nichts <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gehört. (그 남자에게서)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) von ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) von er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) vom ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) von ihn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">von 뒤의 대명사는 3격이에요.<br>er의 3격은 ihm이에요 — von ihm.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;damit&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Hier ist ein Stift. Du kannst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mit + 그것(사물))</span> unterschreiben.</div><div class=\"qko\">여기 펜이 있어요. 그걸로 서명하면 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hier ist ein Stift. Du kannst <b>damit</b> unterschreiben.</div>사물(Stift)을 가리킬 때는 mit es가 아니라 da- + mit → damit이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich gehe heute ohne meinen Schirm aus dem Haus&quot;,&quot;Heute gehe ich ohne meinen Schirm aus dem Haus&quot;,&quot;Ohne meinen Schirm gehe ich heute aus dem Haus&quot;,&quot;Aus dem Haus gehe ich heute ohne meinen Schirm&quot;,&quot;Ich gehe ohne meinen Schirm heute aus dem Haus&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 우산 없이 집을 나서요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">meinen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Haus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">gehe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Schirm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">ohne</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">aus</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich gehe heute ohne meinen Schirm aus dem Haus.</b></div>ohne + 4격(meinen Schirm), aus + 3격(dem Haus)이에요.<br>동사 gehe는 두 번째 자리예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;der&quot;],[&quot;zur&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ich komme gerade aus <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Bäckerei · 여성)</span> Bäckerei und bringe das Brot <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(zu · 이웃 여자 · 여성 · 축약형)</span> Nachbarin.</div><div class=\"qko\">막 빵집에서 나왔고, 빵을 이웃집 아주머니에게 가져다줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich komme gerade aus <b>der</b> Bäckerei und bringe das Brot <b>zur</b> Nachbarin.</div>aus는 3격이라서 aus der Bäckerei예요.<br>사람에게 가져가는 방향은 zu + 3격 → zur Nachbarin이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Ich fahre am Samstag <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Leipzig, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> meiner Tante.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zu … nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) nach … zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) nach … bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) zu … zu</button></div><div class=\"qe\">도시로 가는 방향은 nach Leipzig, 사람에게 가는 방향은 zu meiner Tante예요.<br>bei는 이미 그 사람 집에 있을 때 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zu&quot;],[&quot;nach&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Ich arbeite heute <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Hause. Um vier Uhr fährt mein Mann <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Hause.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 집에서 일해요. 남편은 네 시에 집으로 출발해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich arbeite heute <b>zu</b> Hause. Um vier Uhr fährt mein Mann <b>nach</b> Hause.</div>있는 곳은 zu Hause, 가는 방향은 nach Hause예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Ich spare jeden Monat Geld. — <span class=\"qblank\"></span> sparst du? — Für eine Reise.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Dafür</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wofür</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Womit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Für wen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대답이 사물(eine Reise)이라서 wo- + für → wofür로 물어요.<br>für wen은 사람을 물을 때, dafür는 질문이 아니라 대답에 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;außer&quot;],[&quot;dir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Alle <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~ 말고는)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(du)</span> haben ein Eis bekommen.</div><div class=\"qko\">너 말고는 모두 아이스크림을 받았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Alle <b>außer</b> <b>dir</b> haben ein Eis bekommen.</div>außer(~ 말고는)는 늘 3격이에요.<br>du의 3격은 dir예요 — außer dir.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> '약국은 시청 바로 맞은편에 있어요.' 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Die Apotheke ist direkt gegenüber dem Rathaus.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Apotheke ist direkt gegenüber das Rathaus.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Die Apotheke ist direkt gegenüber den Rathaus.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Die Apotheke ist direkt das Rathaus gegenüber.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gegenüber는 3격과 써요 — das Rathaus → dem Rathaus.<br>명사 뒤에 놓아도 3격이라서 dem Rathaus gegenüber라야 해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Meine Schwester hat ein Fahrrad. Heute fahre ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> zum Markt und trinke danach <span class=\"qblank\"></span> einen Kaffee. (그것을 타고 / 그녀와)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mit es … mit ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) damit … damit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) damit … mit ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) damit … mit sie</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사물(das Fahrrad)은 da- + mit → damit, 사람(meine Schwester)은 mit + 3격 대명사 → mit ihr예요.<br>mit es는 쓰지 않고, mit 뒤의 sie는 3격 ihr로 바꿔요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe dafür zwanzig Euro bezahlt&quot;,&quot;Dafür habe ich zwanzig Euro bezahlt&quot;,&quot;Zwanzig Euro habe ich dafür bezahlt&quot;,&quot;Ich habe zwanzig Euro dafür bezahlt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그걸 사는 데 20유로를 냈어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">zwanzig</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">bezahlt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">dafür</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Euro</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe dafür zwanzig Euro bezahlt.</b></div>dafür는 für + 그것(사물)이에요.<br>현재완료라서 habe는 두 번째, bezahlt는 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seit dem Sommer wohnt Tim bei seinen Großeltern.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Mia fährt mit ihren Freundinnen nach Prag.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Gegenüber der Schule ist ein Kiosk.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Mein Bruder fährt nie ohne seinem Handy weg.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ohne는 늘 4격이에요 — ohne sein Handy.<br>seit·gegenüber·mit는 3격이고, bei seinen Großeltern도 3격 복수라서 나머지 문장은 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;einem&quot;],[&quot;dem&quot;],[&quot;den&quot;],[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Seit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ein- · Monat · 남성)</span> Monat fährt Ben mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Fahrrad · 중성 · 정관사)</span> Fahrrad zur Arbeit. Er fährt durch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(Stadtpark · 남성)</span> Stadtpark und dann <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(Rhein · 남성)</span> Rhein entlang.</div><div class=\"qko\">벤은 한 달 전부터 자전거로 출근해요. 시립 공원을 가로지른 다음 라인강을 따라가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Seit <b>einem</b> Monat fährt Ben mit <b>dem</b> Fahrrad zur Arbeit. Er fährt durch <b>den</b> Stadtpark und dann <b>den</b> Rhein entlang.</div>seit·mit는 3격 → seit einem Monat, mit dem Fahrrad.<br>durch는 4격 → durch den Stadtpark.<br>entlang은 명사 뒤에 놓고 4격을 써요 → den Rhein entlang.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Von wem&quot;],[&quot;Womit&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> hast du die Konzertkarten bekommen? — Von meinem Onkel.<br><input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> hast du die Fahrkarte bezahlt? — Mit meiner Kreditkarte.</div><div class=\"qko\">콘서트 표는 누구한테서 받았어? — 삼촌한테서. / 기차표는 뭘로 계산했어? — 신용카드로.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Von wem</b> hast du die Konzertkarten bekommen? — Von meinem Onkel.<br><b>Womit</b> hast du die Fahrkarte bezahlt? — Mit meiner Kreditkarte.</div>대답이 사람(meinem Onkel)이면 전치사 + wem → von wem이에요.<br>대답이 사물(meiner Kreditkarte)이면 wo- + 전치사 → womit이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihren&quot;],[&quot;ihre&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Die Kinder bekommen von <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr- · Großeltern · 복수)</span> Großeltern Geld für <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr- · Ferien · 복수)</span> Ferien.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들은 조부모님에게서 방학 때 쓸 돈을 받아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Kinder bekommen von <b>ihren</b> Großeltern Geld für <b>ihre</b> Ferien.</div>von은 3격 → 복수 3격 ihren Großeltern이에요.<br>für는 4격 → 복수 4격 ihre Ferien이에요. 둘 다 복수라도 격이 달라요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 다음 문장에서 틀린 부분은?<br><strong>Seit den Frühling geht Opa jeden Abend mit seinem Hund durch das Dorf.</strong></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mit seinem Hund</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) durch das Dorf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) jeden Abend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Seit den Frühling</button></div><div class=\"qe\">seit는 3격이라서 seit dem Frühling이에요.<br>jeden Abend는 전치사 없이 쓰는 4격 시간 표현이라서 맞고, durch das Dorf도 4격이라서 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir sind das Ufer entlang bis zur Brücke gelaufen&quot;,&quot;Bis zur Brücke sind wir das Ufer entlang gelaufen&quot;,&quot;Das Ufer entlang sind wir bis zur Brücke gelaufen&quot;,&quot;Wir sind bis zur Brücke das Ufer entlang gelaufen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 강가를 따라 다리까지 걸었어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Brücke</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">bis</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gelaufen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">zur</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sind</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">entlang</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Ufer</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir sind das Ufer entlang bis zur Brücke gelaufen.</b></div>entlang은 명사 뒤에 와요 — das Ufer entlang(4격).<br>관사가 필요한 '~까지'는 bis zu + 3격 → bis zur Brücke예요. laufen은 sein과 현재완료를 만들어요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"